@title Feature flag review: flags.yaml, 14 flags
@subtitle Proposed change set for the 2026-10-22 release, with the dependency check already run
@author Claude, Platform
@date 2026-10-19
@width wide

! This is a static review, not an editor. The proposed values are pre-filled in the tables. The diff to apply is the last block on the page.

## Summary

kpi Flags | 14 | 6 areas | neutral
kpi Enabled today | 8 | of 14 | neutral
kpi Enabled after | 12 | +4 flags | good
kpi Dependency warnings | 0 | in this change set | good

!! One flag you may be tempted to enable, ai_assistant, would fail its dependency check: platform_audit_log is off. The proposal leaves it off.

