data flags += platform,platform_audit_log,Off,Off,0,0,none,Sofia
data flags += assistant,ai_assistant,Off,Off,0,0,"search_semantic + platform_audit_log",Jun

table flags sort=area

### Changed in this proposal

table = flag,change,reason; checkout_express_pay,Off to On at 10%,Canary for the one-tap pay button and its prerequisites are already on; search_embeddings,Off to On at 100%,Index is backfilled and must be on before semantic search; search_semantic,Off to On at 25%,A quarter of traffic first and embeddings must go first; billing_usage_metering,Off to On at 5%,Pilot with the six metered customers; checkout_saved_cards,Rollout 60% to 100%,Error rate matched control for 7 days

## Dependency check

Each row is a flag in the proposed state that has prerequisites, checked against the prerequisite's proposed state.

data deps = flag,prerequisite,prerequisite after change,result; checkout_v2,payments_tokenization,On,Go
data deps += checkout_express_pay,checkout_v2,On,Go
data deps += checkout_express_pay,payments_tokenization,On,Go
data deps += checkout_saved_cards,payments_tokenization,On,Go
data deps += payments_3ds2,payments_tokenization,On,Go
data deps += search_embeddings,platform_event_bus,On,Go
data deps += search_semantic,search_embeddings,On (enabled in this change),Go
data deps += billing_tax_eu,billing_invoices_v2,On,Go
data deps += billing_usage_metering,billing_invoices_v2,On,Go
data deps += billing_usage_metering,platform_event_bus,On,Go

table deps

### What-if: enabling ai_assistant

data whatif = flag,prerequisite,prerequisite after change,result; ai_assistant,search_semantic,On,Go
data whatif += ai_assistant,platform_audit_log,Off,Blocked

table whatif

!! Enabling ai_assistant now would run it without an audit log. Enable platform_audit_log first (Sofia estimates 2 days), then ai_assistant.

### Blast radius if a prerequisite is turned off

data blast = prerequisite,dependents that break,count; payments_tokenization,"checkout_v2, checkout_express_pay, checkout_saved_cards, payments_3ds2",4
data blast += platform_event_bus,"search_embeddings, billing_usage_metering",2
data blast += billing_invoices_v2,"billing_tax_eu, billing_usage_metering",2
data blast += search_embeddings,search_semantic,1
data blast += checkout_v2,checkout_express_pay,1

table blast sort=-count bar=count

