## Order of operations

1. Deploy the config change with search_embeddings first, since search_semantic requires it.
2. Raise checkout_saved_cards to 100%.
3. Enable checkout_express_pay at 10% and watch the payment error rate for 24 hours.
4. Enable billing_usage_metering at 5%.
5. Move search_semantic to 25% once the embeddings index shows no lag.

